 "_README": [
  "Facility -> city map for PACS postings. PACS publishes no city anywhere in",
  "its Workday feed, only facility names, so this table is how location is",
  "resolved. Built by matching facility names against the CMS Nursing Home",
  "Provider Information dataset (dataset 4pq5-n9py), which is authoritative,",
  "free and requires no key. 70/70 matched.",
  "",
  "Regenerate with scripts/refresh_pacs_facilities.py when new facilities",
  "appear in the review queue. Do not hand-guess entries: 'East Bay Post",
  "Acute' is in Castro Valley not Oakland, 'Sherwood Oaks' is Thousand Oaks",
  "not Marin, and 'Mirage Post Acute' is Lancaster not Rancho Mirage. All",
  "three would have been filed wrong by inspection.",
  "",
  "Cities are passed to geo.py, which decides in-range vs out-of-range."
 ],
